The '''Hegemony Artifact''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Accessories|Accessory]] found in the [[Darker Auction]], which is only available while the special mayor {{NPCSprite|Scorpius}} is in office.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Hegemony Artifact''' can be purchased from the [[Dark Auction|Darker Auction]] when {{NPCSprite|Scorpius}} is mayor. It has a minimum price of {{c|100000000}}.

'''Hegemony Artifact''' can also be obtained as a {{Red|'''MAJOR'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].

== Usage ==
The '''Hegemony Artifact''' has no bonus on its own, but has a special ability where the {{Accessory Power}} of the accessory is doubled. For example, since {{Legendary}} accessories count for 16 Accessory Power, Hegemony Artifact grants 32. When recombobulated to {{Mythic}}, it grants 44 Accessory Power instead of 22.

== Trivia ==
* Before the addition of [[Accessory Power]], the {{Item|Hegemony Artifact}} would double all [[Reforging|Reforge stats]] applied to it.
* [[Enrichments]] are not doubled by this accessory.
* The '''Hegemony Artifact''' is one of the most expensive accessories in the game.
* The '''Hegemony Artifact''' has the same texture of the skull packs in the Housing menu.
* Alongside {{Item|Bingo Talisman}} and its upgrades, and {{Item|Hocus-Pocus Cipher}} (outside of the [[Rift Dimension]]), it does not grant any effects, which means it can only grant boosts through [[Accessory Powers]].

